NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

The MIT grant above covers the source in this repository authored for this
project. It does not and cannot grant rights to Hytale or Hypixel material.

This repository interoperates with the Hytale server. Working copies may
contain, and `.gitignore` deliberately excludes from publication:

  - `decompiled/` and `**/decompiled/` - decompiled `com.hypixel.hytale.*`
    server sources kept as local reference material only.
  - `*.jar` - built plugin jars and any vendored server jars.
  - `artifacts/`, `HytaleRL/artifacts/` - capture trees, and in the case of
    `artifacts/console-hytale/` a Hytale server installation with world data.

None of the above is licensed under the MIT terms above and none of it should
be redistributed. `tools/check_publication_hygiene.py` asserts these paths stay
ignored; CI runs it on every push.
